    "detailed_description": "Hero World is an RPG platformer with 6 levels and a boss fight at the end of each level where you have to use your tactical ability to take on a powerful foe in a turn-based battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe levels are: Ancient Japan, frosty Scandinavia, the Wild West, Caribbean Jungle and Ancient Greece.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 11 types of heroes you can recruit into your team on your journey. The heroes are: Samurai, Knight, Amazon, Viking, Elf, Dwarf, Rogue, Cowboy, Pirate, Ninja and Spartan.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll heroes can be unlocked by playing through the story mode. After completing story mode you can play freely with any character on any level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe barriers of time and space have been shattered. <br />\r\nCreatures from a mystical realm have entered our world. <br />\r\nHeroes from different worlds have emerged to stop the creatures of darkness.",
